<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil Telepar still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil Telepar still a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Banco Patrimonio-Salomon Brothers said in a report it was maintaining its buy rating on Brazil's Telepar, a unit of federally owned Telebras serving Parana state.</p>
<p>-- It said Telepar's 1996 reported earnings of $139 million were slightly below the bank's estimates of $150 million.</p>
<p>-- It added Telepar's full-year results included a $11 million non-operating loss in the last quarter.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
